Hello All,

The following is the interim list price adder to be applied PER "END" of a =
PE fitting needing a machined end not otherwise appearing in Accpac or the =
price sheet.  For instance the fabricated fittings have part numbers and pr=
icing for machined end fittings.  Part numbers and pricing will be added sh=
ortly.

These are based on interim costs yet to be confirmed by further experience.=
  Market receptivity to this pricing is also unknown.

This would apply to molded butt fusion fittings, transitions, adapters etc.

Generally it will be to machine a DR 11 fitting ends to DR  13.5 or higher.=
  The price is the same whatever DR is machined.

For a 6" Tee which has three ends add 3 x $1.50 =3D $4.50 to the list price=
 of the DR 11 6" Tee.

WHEN IN DOUBT ASK QUESTIONS!

REPORT any negative reaction from a customer about this pricing.

Size
List Price/End
2" - 3"
$1.40
4" - 6"
$1.50
8"
$3.10
10"
$3.50
12"
$4.60

John

--_000_9B7E2735CEC37E4D9137A9548F21D78372545FCA12MAIL_
